  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. hypergumbo run on one JS file: el.innerHTML=r and el.outerHTML=r emit no edge, new Function(r)() and setTimeout(r,1)/setInterval(r,1) emit no edge, el.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',r) emits javascript:external:0-0:insertAdjacentHTML; document.write/eval controls reach their sinks (violated). New since filing: b2ee3ebd65 (INV-pivam/INV-rorur, 2026-09-29) added unreached: lists to dom_injection.yaml/code_execution.yaml, so a clean verdict now says confirmed_with_caveats with unreached_sink_shapes naming all four shapes. The recall gap itself is unchanged. MECHANISM: analyzer emits no edge for property assignment, new Function, or string-arg setTimeout; insertAdjacentHTML on an untyped receiver has no module slot. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-zumoz."  # e298
